# ------------------------------------------
# Real Email Delivery Configuration (Gmail / SMTP)
# ------------------------------------------
# To send REAL emails to real Gmail inboxes:
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification in your Google Account (myaccount.google.com/security)
# 2. Search "App Passwords" (myaccount.google.com/apppasswords)
# 3. Create an App Name (e.g. "TaskFlow") and copy the 16-character password
# 4. Fill in EMAIL_USER and EMAIL_PASS below:

